#ASSERT `the list deadline given the publication commencement date` (Date 1 6 2021) `and the first anniversary` (Date 1 6 2022) `and the fifth anniversary` (Date 1 6 2026) `and the regulations' deadline` (JUST (Date 1 6 2026)) `and the agreed deadline` NOTHING EQUALS JUST (Date 1 6 2026)
