-- src:1165 | For the purposes of subclause (2)﻿(b), in relation to the applicable publication requirements for secondary legislation with international transparency obligations,—
-- src:1166 | sections 75 to 77 continue to apply (as in force immediately before the publication commencement date):
-- src:1167 | any direction made under section 76 (or previously under section 36E or 36F of the Legislation Act 2012) continues in force, and may continue to be amended or revoked as if section 76 were still in force:
-- src:1168 | any regulations made for the purposes of the definition of relevant central government entity continue in force, and may continue to be amended or revoked as if section 147(1)﻿(d) were still in force.
#ASSERT `for secondary legislation with international transparency obligations this continues` `sections 75 to 77 (as in force immediately before the publication commencement date)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `for secondary legislation with international transparency obligations this continues` `any direction made under section 76 (or previously under section 36E or 36F of the Legislation Act 2012)` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `for secondary legislation with international transparency obligations this continues` `any regulations made for the purposes of the definition of relevant central government entity` EQUALS JUST TRUE
