§ `Schedule 2 clause 1 -- Requirements to be met on proposal to incorporate material by reference`

-- src:1291 | Before secondary legislation incorporating material by reference in reliance on section 64 is made, the chief executive of the administering agency must—
-- src:1292 | give public notice of the proposal to incorporate the material, of the reasons for the proposal, and of how the material has been made publicly available; and
-- src:1293 | ensure that copies of the proposed material are publicly available in that way; and
-- src:1294 | allow a reasonable opportunity for persons to comment on the proposal; and
-- src:1295 | after considering any comments made and having regard to the purpose of this Act, be satisfied that—
-- src:1296 | the secondary legislation clearly identifies the material incorporated; and
-- src:1297 | the means of making the material publicly available is sufficient to enable persons to whom the law applies to find and obtain copies of the material incorporated with reasonable ease; and
-- src:1298 | it is otherwise appropriate to incorporate the proposed material as part of the secondary legislation.
#ASSERT `the chief executive has met the requirements before the secondary legislation incorporating material is made` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the chief executive has met the requirements before the secondary legislation incorporating material is made` FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the chief executive has met the requirements before the secondary legislation incorporating material is made` TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the chief executive has met the requirements before the secondary legislation incorporating material is made` TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the chief executive has met the requirements before the secondary legislation incorporating material is made` TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the chief executive has met the requirements before the secondary legislation incorporating material is made` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE TRUE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the chief executive has met the requirements before the secondary legislation incorporating material is made` TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE TRUE FALSE EQUALS FALSE

