#ASSERT `the exemption ground is met in the way the deposited text shows` `The relevant chief executive considers that compliance would result in prejudice to New Zealand's position in current negotiations for overseas market access` `when` TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the exemption ground is met in the way the deposited text shows` `The relevant chief executive considers that compliance would result in prejudice to New Zealand's position in current negotiations for overseas market access` `when` FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the exemption ground is met in the way the deposited text shows` `The relevant chief executive considers that compliance would result in prejudice to New Zealand's position in future negotiations for overseas market access` `when` TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the exemption ground is met in the way the deposited text shows` `The relevant chief executive considers that compliance would result in prejudice to New Zealand's position in future negotiations for overseas market access` `when` FALSE EQUALS FALSE
#ASSERT `the exemption ground is met in the way the deposited text shows` `The relevant chief executive considers that compliance would result in prejudice to the international relations of New Zealand` `when` TRUE EQUALS TRUE
#ASSERT `the exemption ground is met in the way the deposited text shows` `The relevant chief executive considers that compliance would result in prejudice to the international relations of New Zealand` `when` FALSE EQUALS FALSE
