#ASSERT `the Chief Parliamentary Counsel may authorise the PCO to make the change` `inserting, replacing or removing a statement relating to notification` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the Chief Parliamentary Counsel may authorise the PCO to make the change` `inserting, replacing or removing a statement relating to publication` EQUALS JUST TRUE
#ASSERT `the Chief Parliamentary Counsel may authorise the PCO to make the change` `inserting, replacing or removing a statement relating to presentation` EQUALS JUST TRUE
